  <template v-else-if="['floorPlan','bimModel'].includes(active)"><div class="spatial-layout"><el-card class="spatial-assets"><template #header><div class="card-head"><div><b>{{spatialName()}}</b><span>{{active==='floorPlan'?'上传项目平面场布图并标注现场监控点':'上传 GLB 模型后，点选构件并绑定现场监测设备'}}</span></div><div class="card-actions"><el-button :icon="Refresh" @click="loadSpatial">刷新</el-button><el-button type="primary" :icon="Plus" @click="openSpatialAsset()">上传{{spatialName()}}</el-button></div></div></template><div v-if="!spatialAssets.length" class="empty-feature small"><el-icon><Location/></el-icon><h2>还没有{{spatialName()}}</h2><p>先上传资源，再添加塔吊、升降机、扬尘噪音、视频监控点。</p></div><button v-for="asset in spatialAssets" :key="asset.id" :class="['spatial-asset-item',{active:spatialAsset?.id===asset.id}]" @click="chooseSpatialAsset(asset)"><b>{{asset.name}}</b><small>{{asset.fileName||asset.fileUrl}}</small><span><el-button link type="primary" @click.stop="openSpatialAsset(asset)">编辑</el-button><el-button link type="danger" @click.stop="deleteSpatialAsset(asset)">删除</el-button></span></button></el-card><el-card class="spatial-stage-card"><template #header><div class="card-head"><div><b>{{spatialAsset?.name||'未选择资源'}}</b><span>{{active==='bimModel'?'新增监控点后点击模型构件完成挂载':'点击“新增监控点”后，可直接点图设置位置'}}</span></div><div class="card-actions"><el-button :disabled="!spatialAsset" type="primary" :icon="Plus" @click="openSpatialPoint()">新增监控点</el-button></div></div></template><div v-if="spatialAsset" class="spatial-stage" @click="placeSpatialPoint"><img v-if="active==='floorPlan'" :src="fullFileUrl(spatialAsset.fileUrl)" alt="平面场布图"/><div v-else-if="isGlbAsset(spatialAsset)" ref="bimViewerEl" class="bim-viewer"><div v-if="bimLoading" class="bim-overlay">模型加载中...</div><div v-if="bimError" class="bim-overlay error">{{bimError}}</div></div><div v-else class="bim-placeholder"><el-icon><OfficeBuilding/></el-icon><h2>{{spatialAsset.fileName||'BIM模型文件'}}</h2><p>当前文件格式暂不支持直接预览。GLB/GLTF 可直接加载；RVT/IFC 后续需要转换后再做构件级选择。</p></div><bu